```java
@Transactional
public TaskView scheduleAssignment(String incidentKey, String taskKey, String actor, AssignmentRequest req) {
    String requestId = requireText(req.requestId(), "requestId");
    if (req.expectedTaskVersion() == null) throw badRequest("expectedTaskVersion 不能为空");
    long expectedVersion = req.expectedTaskVersion();
    String assignee = requireText(req.assignee(), "assignee");
    if (req.startAt() == null || req.endAt() == null) throw badRequest(...);
    Instant startAt = req.startAt(); Instant endAt = req.endAt();
    // 整分钟校验
    if (startAt.getEpochSecond() % 60 != 0 || endAt.getEpochSecond() % 60 != 0) throw badRequest("安排时段须为 UTC 整分钟");
    long minutes = Duration.between(startAt, endAt).toMinutes();
    if (minutes < 1 || minutes > 240) throw badRequest("安排时长须为 1~240 分钟");
    Incident incident = lockIncident(incidentKey);
    requireCommander(incident, actor);  // 权限先于重放
    return runIdempotent(requestId, "task_schedule",
            structuredHash("task_schedule", incidentKey, taskKey, actor, assignee, startAt.toString(), endAt.toString(), expectedVersion),
            TaskView.class, () -> {
                IncidentTask task = tasks.findByKey(incident.id(), taskKey).orElseThrow(notFound);
                if (task.status() == DONE/CANCELLED) → 409 终态
                if (task.status() == STARTED) → 422 已开始不可改时
                if (task.version() != expectedVersion) → 409 版本
                assignments.lockAssignments();
                var existing = assignments.findByTaskId(task.id());
                validateAssignmentConstraints(assignee, startAt, endAt, task.id());
                Instant now = now();
                if (existing.isPresent()) update else insert
                int bumped = tasks.bumpVersionIfOpen(task.id(), (int) expectedVersion, now);
                if (bumped == 0) throw conflict 版本已变化
                return toTaskView(tasks.findByKey(...).orElseThrow());
            });
}
```

Wait — version check: I check task.version() != expectedVersion → 409 before lock; then bumpVersionIfOpen conditional update as atomic guard. Both fine.

Note expectedVersion is Long; task.version() is int. Compare with long.

Validation logic:

```java
private void validateAssignmentConstraints(String assignee, Instant startAt, Instant endAt, long excludeTaskId) {
    List<TaskAssignment> others = assignments.listByAssignee(assignee).stream()
            .filter(a -> a.taskId() != excludeTaskId).toList();
    // 合并区间排序
    List<TaskAssignment> all = new ArrayList<>(others);
    all.add(new TaskAssignment(0, excludeTaskId, assignee, startAt, endAt, null, startAt, startAt));
    all.sort(Comparator.comparing(TaskAssignment::startAt).thenComparing(TaskAssignment::endAt));
    for (int i = 1; i < all.size(); i++) {
        TaskAssignment prev = all.get(i-1); TaskAssignment next = all.get(i);
        long gap = Duration.between(prev.endAt(), next.startAt()).toMinutes();
        if (gap < 0) → 422 重叠 details {type OVERLAP, date: prev.endAt date, ...}
        if (gap < 30) → 422 休息不足 details {type REST, date, requiredRestMinutes 30, actualGapMinutes gap, shortfallMinutes 30-gap}
    }
    // 日上限
    Map<LocalDate, Long> perDay = new HashMap<>();
    for (a : all) splitByDay(a.startAt, a.endAt) accumulate
    for entry: if total > 480 → 422 details {type DAILY_LIMIT, date, limitMinutes 480, scheduledMinutes total, excessMinutes total-480}
}
```

Overlap: if gap < 0 it's overlap. Should overlap also be 422? "人员全部安排不重叠" — yes 422. The 422 spec mentions 休息或日上限 with date and 差额； overlap I'll also make 422 with details.

Wait, careful with adjacent check when intervals are equal (zero-length not possible since min 1 min). Sorting by start; if two intervals have same start, gap computed with prev.end vs next.start — negative → overlap. Good.

Daily split: for interval [s, e), iterate days from s's date to (e-1s)'s date:
```java
Instant cursor = s;
while (cursor.isBefore(e)) {
    LocalDate day = cursor.atOffset(UTC).toLocalDate();
    Instant dayEnd = day.plusDays(1).atStartOfDay().toInstant(UTC);
    Instant segEnd = e.isBefore(dayEnd) ? e : dayEnd;
    perDay.merge(day, Duration.between(cursor, segEnd).toMinutes(), Long::sum);
    cursor = segEnd;
}
```

Check days in deterministic order (sorted) so the first violating day is reported.

